  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/682/772/title.png\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此材質包將原木紋理還原為 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fJava_Edition_18w43a\" rel=\"nofollow\">18w43a</a> 快照版中的樣式。新木材類型（如紅樹林、櫻花木、緋紅菌柄及扭曲菌柄）的原木紋理也已更改為該快照版所採用的風格。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您可以在此處支持我和我的項目：<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/AmongstReality\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/SomeImages/blob/main/patreon.png?raw=true\" width=\"1920\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>",
